  "worked_solution": "Recall that\n\n$$\n\\int sin\u2061\\theta \\,\\text{d}\\theta =-cos\u2061\\theta +C.\n$$\n\nTherefore, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\begin{aligned}\\int (-6sin\u2061\\theta )\\,\\text{d}\\theta  & =-6\\int sin\u2061\\theta \\,\\text{d}\\theta  \\\\  & =-6(-cos\u2061\\theta )+C \\\\  & =6cos\u2061\\theta +C.\\end{aligned}\\end{aligned}\n$$",
